{"id":"vod_sn_37224","vodId":"37224","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"只有神知道的世界第二季","name_cn":"只有神知道的世界第二季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/38caba2c87dce608213f96d8a15e61fc.jpg"},"summary":"以若木民喜的同名漫画为原著的动画《只有神知道的世界》宣布第1季在2011年1月4日起在日本重播的同时，在其连载的漫画杂志《周刊少年 SUNDAY》上宣布推出第二季动画《只有神知道的世界Ⅱ》。擅长恋爱游戏甚至被称为“攻略之神”的少年——桂木桂马在来自冥界的恶魔艾露西的强迫下，与她结下了地狱的契约。两人已经一起成功捕捉了四只驱魂。这一次在二人面前出现了新的驱魂队成员。在这一季里，将会出现新的攻略对象，武术传承者春日楠，现实女孩中的现实女孩小阪千寻以及学校的实习教师长濑纯。攻略故事就由此再一次展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:50:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/70uP60MRVQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ifqRa9ezix1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/HvJs2K1qJY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/umuSmKMz5p1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/MfmyfdEm8p1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/w8r9XReSKg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/1mDJTmDDww1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/BJ6irtDUhG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ELkHcuKGWJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Qwr53AVqch1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HYpDtq3UFj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ndzim4dafF1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:13.708Z"}